  "core": "Source turns the wheel at the threshold — what enters here enters all positions. In Discipline, that entry works on the lantern itself: the light guiding deliberate work grows brighter or dimmer depending on what the wheel brings through. The practitioner tends the lamp without naming what feeds it, crediting their own steadiness for what the threshold supplies. The tending continues; the source stays unnamed.",
